.TH FD_FILESIZE 3
.SH NAME
fd_filesize \- get the size of an open file descriptor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mmap.h"
.PP
.BI "ssize_t fd_filesize(fd_type " fd ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fd_filesize
returns the size in bytes of the file referred to by the file descriptor
.IR fd .
It uses platform-specific mechanisms (e.g.,
.BR fstat (2)
on POSIX,
.BR GetFileSize (3)
on Windows) to determine the length of the file.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the file size in bytes on success, or -1 on error.